# Title: Potential Remote PowerShell Session Initiated
# ID: c539afac-c12a-46ed-b1bd-5a5567c9f045
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Roberto Rodriguez @Cyb3rWard0g
# Date: 2019-09-12
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059.001, attack.lateral-movement, attack.t1021.006
# Description: Detects a process that initiated a network connection over ports 5985 or 5986 from a non-network service account.
# This could potentially indicates a remote PowerShell connection.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((dest_port=5985 OR dest_port=5986) AND Initiated="true" AND SourceIsIpv6="false") AND NOT ((((src_ip="::1" OR src_ip="127.0.0.1") AND (dest_ip="::1" OR dest_ip="127.0.0.1")) OR (((user="*NETWORK SERVICE*" OR user="*NETZWERKDIENST*" OR user="*SERVICIO DE RED*" OR user="*SERVIZIO DI RETE*")) OR ((user="*SERVICE R*" AND user="*SEAU*"))))) AND NOT (((process_path="C:\\Program Files\\Avast Software\\Avast\\AvastSvc.exe" OR process_path="C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Avast Software\\Avast\\AvastSvc.exe"))))
